\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces H4 training trajectory: training-time validation FID (left axis, red) and R@1 (right axis, blue) across the late training segment. Epoch\nobreakspace  {}3399 is the best checkpoint (highest R@1, FID within noise of epoch\nobreakspace  {}3199, and best definitive 3-replication FID); both metrics then degrade steadily through epoch\nobreakspace  {}4999. Training loss is flat across this range — sampling quality oscillates independently of training loss.\relax }}{14}{figure.caption.26}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:h4_training}{{4}{14}{H4 training trajectory: training-time validation FID (left axis, red) and R@1 (right axis, blue) across the late training segment. Epoch~3399 is the best checkpoint (highest R@1, FID within noise of epoch~3199, and best definitive 3-replication FID); both metrics then degrade steadily through epoch~4999. Training loss is flat across this range — sampling quality oscillates independently of training loss.\relax }{figure.caption.26}{}}
